@startuml
title View Building Card

actor User
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "Backend API" as API
database "Core DB" as DB
participant "External Data Services" as Ext

User -> UI : Request building card
UI -> API : GET /buildings/{id}
API -> DB : Fetch base record
API -> Ext : Fetch external data
Ext --> API : External data
API --> UI : Return full building card
UI --> User : Display data
@enduml
